{
  "__comment": "offshoot daemon dashboard \u2014 covers all 18 offshoot_* metric families served by GET /metrics (see docs/operations.md#metrics; names locked per that page). Generated for schemaVersion 39; import via Dashboards > Import and pick your Prometheus datasource.",
