      "description": "rate(offshoot_fork_mode_total{mode}): shared = a base pointer into the parent's chain, zero data objects copied (the copy-on-write common case); materialized = a full snapshot copy (the fork-time snapshot floor). This split IS the storage cost of the fork feature.",
